## Review Checklists

### States (every screen)
- [ ] Happy path — all required fields, expected data
- [ ] Empty state — first use, no data, zero results
- [ ] Loading state — skeleton, spinner, or progressive load
- [ ] Error state — API fail, validation fail, permission denied
- [ ] Recovery path — how user gets back to a good state

### Edge Cases (Enterprise B2B — from `context/enterprise-b2b-patterns.md`)
- [ ] Offline / degraded network
- [ ] Permission denied (role-based access)
- [ ] Session timeout mid-flow
- [ ] Rate limiting / API quota exceeded
- [ ] Multi-tenant data isolation
- [ ] Large data sets (100+ rows, long text fields)
- [ ] Accessibility (keyboard nav, screen reader, contrast)
- [ ] Mobile/tablet if product is responsive

### PRD Alignment
- [ ] Every user story has at least one screen
- [ ] All success metrics have a measurable touchpoint in the UI
- [ ] Business assumptions are visible in the design

### Business Assumptions
- [ ] User behavior assumptions stated explicitly
- [ ] Business outcome assumptions stated explicitly
- [ ] At least one P0 assumption has a zero-budget test proposed

